---
// GovernanceSection.astro - Leadership & Standing Committees (Constitution Article VI & Bylaws 2026-2027)
---

<section id="governance" class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-[#090C12] border-t border-b border-slate-800/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37]/10 text-[#F5D77F] font-mono text-xs mb-4 border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
        Article VI • Constitutional Governance
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">
        Leadership & <span class="gold-gradient-text">Committees</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        A structured constitutional body governed by collective leadership, accountability, and specialized standing committees driving academic and social impact.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Executive Committee Tier -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#D4AF37] uppercase tracking-widest">Executive Committee</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Current Term 2026–2027</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <!-- Exec 1 -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#D4AF37] block mb-1">HEAD OF THE BODY</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Senior Executive</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Overall administrative head, presiding officer, external representative, and constitutional guardian.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Exec 2 -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-1">INTERNAL AFFAIRS</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Junior Executive</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Oversees committee coordination, operational execution, and internal member welfare.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Exec 3 -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-1">RECORDS & ARCHIVES</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Executive Secretary</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Custodian of body meeting minutes, official correspondence, and digital document repositories.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Exec 4 -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-1">TREASURY & AUDIT</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Treasurer & Auditor</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Manages organizational funds, revolving fees, bank accounts, and monthly financial audits.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The 5 Standing Committees Grid -->
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#D4AF37] uppercase tracking-widest">Standing Committees & Specialized Wings</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Committee 1: Scholastics -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <span class="text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">📖</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Scholastics Committee</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Organizes the flagship <strong>UPLB Math Wizard</strong> competition, inter-high school math challenges, academic review sessions, and free campus tutorials.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#D4AF37]">Academic Excellence Focus</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Committee 2: Finance -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <span class="text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">💰</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Finance Committee</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Oversees the Collector subteam, Sacri meals, equipment rental logistics, liability settlement FRA, and the official Merit/Demerit tracker.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#D4AF37]">Fiscal Governance Focus</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Committee 3: Business -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <span class="text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">💼</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Business Committee</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Handles external sponsorships, enterprise partnerships, merchandise production, and representation in the UPLB Council of Student Leaders (CSL).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#D4AF37]">Partnerships & Revenue</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Committee 4: Membership & Discipline -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <span class="text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">🛡️</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Membership & Discipline</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Facilitates applicant orientation, process finals, active resident status verification, constitutional compliance, and member welfare tracking.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#D4AF37]">Onboarding & Ethics</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Committee 5: Sports & Socials -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <span class="text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">🏆</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100">Sports & Socials</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Spearheads intramural sports tournaments, STRASUC participation, alumni fellowship nights, team-building retreats, and anniversary galas.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#D4AF37]">Camaraderie & Brotherhood</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Specialized Wings: Marketing & The Chronicle -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 flex flex-col justify-between bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900/90 to-slate-950">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <span class="text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-[#D4AF37]/10 border border-[#D4AF37]/30">📡</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[#F5D77F]">Marketing & The Chronicle</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Autonomous editorial and creative teams managing digital broadcasting, research newsletters, social campaigns, and official press releases.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#F5D77F]">Digital Media & Journal</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
